t }_{0}^{2}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =(u\\,i-2\\,j-2\\,k)\\cdot (4\\,i-2\\,j+\\,k) \\\\  & =4u+4-2 \\\\  & =4u+2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since ${\\int }_{0}^{2}c\\cdot f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=0,$ we must have $4u+2=0,$ which means that $u=-\\frac{1}{2}.$" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376694 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376695 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376696 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376697 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376698 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1041 "selection" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1104 #edb/ref 17592186376694 13194139535960 true] [17592186376693 1110 #uuid "e46f5e07-5aab-5975-8c4b-b5746d86b5ed" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376694 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376694 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376694 1111 #uuid "fb00428e-cf5a-53d7-8a5a-277aa199ba16" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376695 1034 "2" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376695 1111 #uuid "9963c1f5-e819-5ab8-ab1d-b047de2352e6" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376696 1034 "1" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376696 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376696 1111 #uuid "3ca9c48c-5d97-5858-96dc-b100eaf900b3" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376697 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376697 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376697 1111 #uuid "2d4e055f-e1e3-5351-b7cd-6246f216995d" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376698 1034 "-1" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376698 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376698 1111 #uuid "3ad9ec80-816a-5022-a511-1052986b2330" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1017 #edb/ref 17592186376700 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1089 "q-98186" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1100 "Calculate \n${\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)+⟨-1,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}t$\ngiven that\n${\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t=⟨5,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩.$" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1113 #uuid "f6362c37-2e32-54b3-8aa0-c3cb9e6d3761" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376699 1145 "Let's reverse the limits of integration on the known result:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t & =-{\\int }_{3}^{0}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-⟨5,\\,-1,\\,-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying the vector addition rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)+⟨-1,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}t & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t+{\\int }_{0}^{3}⟨-1,\\,1,\\,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩+{⟨-t,\\,t,\\,-t⟩|}_{0}^{3} \\\\  & =⟨-5,\\,1,\\,2⟩+⟨-3,\\,3,\\,-3⟩\\text{ } \\\\  & =⟨-8,\\,4,\\,-1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376701 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376702 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376703 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376704 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1000 #edb/ref 17592186376705 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1041 "selection" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1104 #edb/ref 17592186376703 13194139535960 true] [17592186376700 1110 #uuid "f9dd286c-634d-5116-af5c-be584f50c0a9" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376701 1034 "⟨-8,\\,2,\\,1⟩" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376701 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376701 1111 #uuid "9fe11060-0fdf-50c3-9d11-b01225e359a1" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376702 1034 "⟨8,\\,4,\\,1⟩" 13194139535960 true] [17592186376702 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535960 true] [17592186376702 1111 #uuid "f7d6a85a-52ee-5ea1-8cbd-91797e1b8e28" 13194139535960 true] [17592